@endif

@choice leave "Leave" -> place.high-school
  @time 5m
@endchoice

:: place.high-school.student-council-room
@heading "Student Council Office"


The office is open, but there's hardly anyone there.


@choice leave "Leave" -> place.high-school
  @time 1m
@endchoice

